# Pairs with PerToolMinimum. The pre-#4082 shape: the minimum is applied only
# when the resolver supplied operation detail, so absent evidence reads as
# permission and a group-only access set reaches the whole group.
MODULE: MinimumOnlyWithOperationDetail
TARGET: PerToolMinimum
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the per-tool minimum is skipped when the access set carries no operations
PERTURBS: OpenSession

--- FIND
ToolGroup(t) \in groups /\ ops \cap Required(t) # {} /\ Gate(TRUE, policy, t)}
--- REPLACE
ToolGroup(t) \in groups /\ (ops = {} \/ ops \cap Required(t) # {}) /\ Gate(TRUE, policy, t)}
--- END
